s logging."},{"question_ordinal":30,"time_seconds":404.3,"text":"We were hoping for the end of next week, if that's not too late."}]},"groups":[{"external_id":"original-listening-1:s3:g1","ordinal":1,"instructions":"Questions 21-23\nChoose the correct letter, A, B or C.","shared_options":null,"questions":[{"external_id":"original-listening-1:q21","ordinal":21,"type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"Mei and Tom disagree about","options":[{"label":"A","text":"how many sites to sample"},{"label":"B","text":"which data should lead the report"},{"label":"C","text":"how long to sample at each site"}],"correct_answer":"B","accepted_variants":[],"evidence":{"kind":"transcript","time_seconds":292.7,"text":"Mei wants to lead with the water chemistry. I think the invertebrate counts tell the story better."}},{"external_id":"original-listening-1:q22","ordinal":22,"type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"Tom prefers the invertebrate counts because","options":[{"label":"A","text":"they are easier to collect"},{"label":"B","text":"they show conditions on the sampling day"},{"label":"C","text":"they reflect conditions over months"}],"correct_answer":"C","accepted_variants":[],"evidence":{"kind":"transcript","time_seconds":302.6,"text":"Because the chemistry only shows what the river was like on the day we sampled. The invertebrates reflect months of conditions."}},{"external_id":"original-listening-1:q23","ordinal":23,"type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"Mei's reason for preferring the chemistry is that","options":[{"label":"A","text":"readers will expect it"},{"label":"B","text":"it is more reliable"},{"label":"C","text":"it was collected first"}],"correct_answer":"A","accepted_variants":[],"evidence":{"kind":"transcript","time_seconds":318.5,"text":"Only that the chemistry is what our reader will expect. But I take Tom's point, and I'd rather be right than conventional."}}]},{"external_id":"original-listening-1:s3:g2","ordinal":2,"instructions":"Questions 24-26\nComplete the sentences below.\